1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
为什么夏天热、冬天冷？
Why is summer hot and winter cold?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,250
离太阳近？
Because we are closer to the Sun?

3
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:14,700
1月最近，却是冬天！
Closest in January, yet it is winter!

4
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:21,000
地轴方向不变
The axis always points the same way

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,000
直射：集中 → 热
Straight on: concentrated → hot

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,700
斜射：摊开 → 冷
Slanted: spread out → cold

7
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:27,700
6月：北半球 夏
June: summer in the north

8
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:29,000
12月：北半球 冬
December: winter in the north

9
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,200
南半球：冬 · 南半球：夏
In the south: winter · summer

10
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:36,000
澳洲的圣诞在夏天
Christmas in Australia is in summer

11
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,000
是地轴倾斜！
It is the tilted axis!
